---
const images = [
  { src: "/images/category-safaris.avif", alt: "Safari vehicle crossing the savanna" },
  { src: "/images/lodge-siringit-camp.jpg", alt: "Comfortable lodge tent interior" },
  { src: "/images/why-travel-cheetah.jpg", alt: "Cheetah resting in golden grass" },
  { src: "/images/itinerary-tarangire-ngorongoro.jpg", alt: "Elephants beneath the baobabs in Tarangire" },
  { src: "/images/lodge-zuri-zanzibar.webp", alt: "Relaxed seating inside a safari vehicle" },
  { src: "/images/destination-tanzania.avif", alt: "Zebras grazing on the Serengeti plains" },
];
---

<section class="w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto mt-20 md:mt-32 flex flex-col items-center px-4 sm:px-8">
  <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl text-center leading-tight text-primary">
    How a Private Safari With Atlas Works
  </h2>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 max-w-[820px] mt-8">
    <p class="font-body text-base text-center leading-[162.5%] text-text">
      Tanzania is more than a destination. It is a place of extraordinary landscapes, unforgettable
      wildlife, vibrant cultures and moments that stay with you long after you leave.
    </p>
    <p class="font-body text-base text-center leading-[162.5%] text-text">
      We create private, tailor-made journeys designed around your interests, your pace and your
      dreams, from the endless plains of the Serengeti and the slopes of Kilimanjaro to the white
      sands of Zanzibar. It is your own vehicle and your own guide, so the day moves at your speed
      and never someone else's itinerary.
    </p>
    <p class="font-body text-base text-center leading-[162.5%] text-text">
      Tanzania is our home. As a Tanzanian-owned company, we take care of the journey behind the
      journey: the accommodations, the transfers and the small details. That is how a holiday
      becomes a story worth telling.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 w-full mt-10">
    {
      images.map((image) => (
        <div class="h-48 sm:h-56 md:h-64 rounded-lg overflow-clip">
          <img src={image.src} alt={image.alt} class="size-full object-cover" />
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </div>
</section>
